#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Storage Engine v3 — Distributed Replication
#  File: storage_engine_v3_distributed.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS Storage Engine v3:
#      • distributed block replication
#      • quorum-based write commits
#      • replica health tracking
#      • distributed snapshots
#      • cluster-aware restore
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Distributed Volumes](ca://s?q=Explain_Distributed_Volumes)
#    - [Quorum Writes](ca://s?q=Explain_Quorum_Writes)
#    - [Replica Health](ca://s?q=Explain_Replica_Health)
#    - [Distributed Snapshots](ca://s?q=Explain_Distributed_Snapshots)
#    - [Cluster Restore](ca://s?q=Explain_Cluster_Restore)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - create_volume(name, size_mb, replicas)
#         Creates distributed volume with replica nodes.
#
#    - write_block(volume_id, block, data)
#         Writes block with quorum replication.
#
#    - read_block(volume_id, block)
#         Reads block locally.
#
#    - snapshot(volume_id)
#         Creates distributed snapshot.
#
#    - restore(snapshot_id)
#         Restores snapshot across cluster.
#
#    - engine_snapshot()
#         Returns distributed storage engine state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  DISTRIBUTED VOLUME FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "id": "DVOL-XXXX",
#      "name": "rootfs",
#      "size_mb": 2048,
#      "blocks": { ... },
#      "created": <epoch>
#    }
#
#===============================================================================
#  REPLICA SET FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "DVOL-XXXX": ["NODE-A", "NODE-B", "NODE-C"]
#    }
#
